# Netlify-only. The live site runs nginx, which ignores this file entirely —
# see deploy/nginx.conf for the config that actually routes production, and
# deploy/README.md for the rules all of them share.
#
# SPA fallbacks. The /admin rules must come first — the catch-all below would
# otherwise hand the panel's deep links to the storefront document.
/admin       /admin.html   200
/admin/*     /admin.html   200
# Old top-level bookmark; the panel redirects it on to /admin/login.
/login       /admin.html   200
/*           /index.html   200
